---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="ceb">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#15271f" />
    <title>Offline · Pamilihang Carbon</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest" />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen grid place-items-center p-6">
    <main class="price-tag max-w-xl p-8 text-center">
      <p class="kicker">Offline · Walay koneksyon</p>
      <h1 class="display mt-5 text-5xl sm:text-6xl">Wala ka online karon.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[var(--muted)]">Ang giya sa Carbon Market ma-ablihan pag-usab kung mobalik ang imong koneksyon. Ang mga panid nga nabisita na nimo mahimong maablihan gikan sa cache.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex border-2 border-[var(--ink)] bg-[var(--market-orange)] px-5 py-3 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[4px_4px_0_var(--ink)]">Balik sa Carbon</a>
        <a href="/fil/" class="inline-flex border-2 border-[var(--ink)] bg-[var(--paper)] px-5 py-3 font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider">Filipino</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-5 text-[var(--muted)]">Pamilihang Carbon · 59 M. C. Briones St, Cebu City, 6000 Cebu, Philippines</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
